<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan group to tender for 54,000 tonnes corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan group to tender for 54,000 tonnes corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP corn-buying group will tender on Tuesday for a shipment of 54,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The FGEP group comprises Fwu Sow Grain, Great Wall Enterprise, President Enterprise and Ever Smile Feed mill Co.</p>
